        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14661\">PR #14661</a> from <code>xia-chao:fix/serve-max-concurrent-zero</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Both limits were plain <code>usize</code> I think, so <code>--max-concurrent-requests=0</code> went through. The server kept accepting connections but didn't handle a single request...</p>\n<p>They're <code>NonZeroUsize</code> now, so a zero is rejected while parsing.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
